   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5.2% of inserts collide by year 5\n  = 1 in 19, about 61 per second\n4.7 billion collisions over 5 years\n\nDeterministic, so the retry MUST\nchange the input - rehashing the\nsame URL collides forever.",
