   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "gcd(K, 62^7) = 1, so the map is a\nBIJECTION - distinct counters can\nnever produce the same code.\n\nOne coordination call per 100,000\nlinks. The scramble also stops\nneighbours being enumerable.",
