   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Collisions cost nothing when they\nhappen in a batch job with nobody\nwaiting - generate, let the primary\nkey reject dupes, loop.\n\nNew failure mode: the pool running\ndry stops writes entirely.",
   "originalText": "Collisions cost nothing when they\nhappen in a batch job with nobody\nwaiting - generate, let the primary\nkey reject dupes, loop.\n\nNew failure mode: the pool running\ndry stops writes entirely.",
